# Lab Notebook — {{ project_name }}

Chronological record of **Runs** — each a computational implementation of the
project with a given set of scientific parameters. (Software fixes/refactors are
Git commits, not new runs; see `AGENTS.md`.)

Generate a stub for the current run and fill in the human-owned fields:

```bash
python scripts/register_run.py "short note"          # log it in metadata/runs.csv
python scripts/lab_notebook_entry.py >> reporting/writeups/LAB_NOTEBOOK.md
```

Machine fields (`execution_id`, `artifact_id`, parameters, git) are pulled from
`results/provenance.json`; **a person writes** the objective, what worked / did
not, and the biological/statistical interpretation.

